<% const story = site.data.gallery.series[0]; const posts = site.posts.sort('date',-1).toArray(); %>
<section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="little-flower" aria-hidden="true">✳</span> JANE WANG · 生活漫画</p><h1>把日子，<br>画成<span class="rose-word">小故事。</span></h1><p class="hero-description">大狗、小狗和墨狗的日常。<br>记录那些舒服、好笑，<br class="mobile-only">也有一点点狼狈的时刻。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="<%= url_for(story.path) %>">读最新的故事 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="<%= url_for('/gallery/') %>">逛逛画廊 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p class="hero-note">两个人，一只小狗，和过不完的小日常。</p></div><div class="hero-art"><span class="hero-scribble">a little everyday.</span><a class="hero-paper" href="<%= url_for(story.path) %>" aria-label="阅读秋日露台漫画"><img src="<%= url_for('/images/autumn-terrace/04-1122.webp') %>" width="1122" height="1402" fetchpriority="high" alt="Frank 看书，Jane 和墨宝窝在月亮椅上，this is living."><span class="paper-caption"><span>秋日露台</span><span>EP. 01 / 09 张</span></span></a><span class="paper-dot" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div></section>
<section class="story-band"><div class="wrap story-band-inner"><span class="eyebrow">LATEST STORY / 最新一篇</span><div><h2><%= story.title %></h2><p>整个夏天没用上的露台，终于开张了。<br>只是这阵风，好像比想象中认真。</p></div><a class="round-link" href="<%= url_for(story.path) %>" aria-label="阅读秋日露台">↗</a></div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">IN THE GALLERY</p><h2>几个日常切片<span class="small-spark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="<%= url_for('/gallery/') %>">全部 <%= story.pages.length %> 张 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="art-grid"><% [0,3,7].forEach(function(i){ %><%- partial('_partial/card',{story:story,art:story.pages[i]}) %><% }); %></div></section>
<section class="wrap characters-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE LITTLE CAST</p><h2>大狗、小狗<br>和墨狗。</h2><a class="text-link" href="<%= url_for('/about/') %>">认识他们 →</a></div><div class="cast-list"><div class="cast-item"><span class="cast-dot frank-dot">F</span><div><h3>Frank <small>大狗 · 边牧</small></h3><p>看书、研究问题。话不多，小表情也有戏。</p></div></div><div class="cast-item"><span class="cast-dot jane-dot">J</span><div><h3>Jane <small>小狗 · 吉娃娃</small></h3><p>零食、书和手机。总能发现日常里的一点小意思。</p></div></div><div class="cast-item"><span class="cast-dot mobao-dot">M</span><div><h3>墨宝 <small>墨狗 · 小黑泰迪</small></h3><p>是真正的小狗。忙着窝在腿上，也忙着发现小鸟。</p></div></div></div></section>
<% if(posts.length > 1){ %><section class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>继续翻翻</h2><a href="<%= url_for('/archives/') %>" class="text-link">所有故事 →</a></div><div class="post-list"><% posts.slice(1,4).forEach(function(post){ %><a class="post-row" href="<%= url_for(post.path) %>"><time><%= date(post.date,'YYYY.MM.DD') %></time><h3><%= post.title %></h3><span>↗</span></a><% }); %></div></section><% } %>
<section class="wrap licensing-callout"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div><h2>喜欢这些画？先聊聊怎么用。</h2><p>转载、出版或合作，请先取得授权，并保留作者与来源署名。</p></div><a class="text-link" href="<%= url_for('/licensing/') %>">查看授权说明 ↗</a></section>
